Mon Oct 26 11:20:55 UTC 2026 - Paolo Stivanin <info@paolostivanin.com>

- Update to 0.11.2 (upstream tag v0.11.2, 2026-10-25; covers the
  skipped 0.10.x/0.11.x tags):
  * New Boards file kind (collaborative whiteboard), Dev Mode
    additions (imports in layer trees, compare with versions,
    inspect-only canvas, measurements, read-only layers panel),
    Text on a path tool, corner smoothing on polygons and stars,
    variable binding for text styles, font family and Selection
    colors, one presentation tab per page, notice before a
    prototype link leaves for a website.
  * Large security hardening batch: symlink traversal in the asset
    walker, owner-only recovery and data-directory permissions,
    bounded decoding and layout caches, linear-time vector, SVG and
    export paths, per-client secret for collab resume, per-IPv6
    prefix storage caps, plugin restrictions on library and font
    paths.
  * Many engine, UI and MCP/control-channel fixes and additions
    from the community batches; PDF now written with craft-libs'
    krilla; CI and packaging script hygiene.
  * Re-vendored with update=false against the upstream lockfile.
    Vendor licences re-audited: all in the shipped targets are
    under licences already listed; r-efi (MIT OR Apache-2.0 OR
    LGPL-2.1-or-later, UEFI only) is taken under MIT/Apache-2.0,
    so License is unchanged; no new copyleft, MSRV still 1.95.
  * Vendor audit: no RUSTSEC advisories reported.

