Wed Oct 21 06:40:33 UTC 2026 - Paolo Stivanin <info@paolostivanin.com>

- Update to 0.8.0 (upstream tag v0.8.0, 2026-10-20):
  * Home: search files and templates; list fonts a file uses that
    are not installed; canvas frame rename by double-click; View
    toggles such as Rulers kept in preferences.
  * Web build opens files; CLI info, export, convert, render and run
    are confined to automation roots; desktop refuses unknown
    command-line options.
  * New Dutch, French (draft) and Finnish interface catalogs.
  * Fixes: prototype delete, bound colour variable alpha, recovery
    folder lock wait, REST import of slot layers.
- Update to 0.7.0 (upstream tag v0.7.0, 2026-10-18):
  * Community batches of reviewed fixes: pen bezier handles,
    gradient icons, SVG export clipping, system clipboard in the
    browser, outline stroke on all selected layers, Japanese labels.
  * Packaging: RPM declares the glibc 2.35 floor.
  * Re-vendored; no new system deps.

