Fri Oct 16 13:13:37 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- New package: FigCraft 0.6.0 (upstream tag v0.6.0, 2026-10-14),
  native interface design and prototyping tool plus headless
  figcraft-cli:
  * Everyday editing: number fields, outline options, Hide when
    publishing, cursors, panel widths, dark pages.
  * Starter templates with a Templates section and first-run help;
    recent files as thumbnail cards with list view and sorting.
  * Online files with remembered ownership and crash recovery;
    online-sharing terms with a build-time server switch (kept at
    the upstream default).
  * .fig export: instance sizes, variables with modes, shared styles,
    variable-width strokes; Leptos dev-mode code export.
  * Core editor: wrapped-line alignment, prototype delays and overlay
    offsets, frame/group convert, effects on groups, full screen mode.
  * Security hardening (no CVE ids): ruzstd 0.9.1 fixes the
    RUSTSEC-2026-0344 decompression-bomb DoS; bounded SVG/SVGZ and
    plugin inputs, layer-cycle repair, owner-only preferences.
  * Vendored with update=false against the upstream lockfile; license
    re-derived over the shipped targets (see the spec notice).

